ses specifically on Annex III requirements.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will build a verification dashboard where natural persons must digitally sign off on search matches, automatically capturing their IDs and timestamps into the system log. The module will link these identities to specific input data matches.\",\n      \"why\": \"This directly addresses the mandatory legal requirements for high-risk systems under Article 12(3).\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
