at might indicate a substantial modification or safety risk. It transforms raw logs into actionable alerts.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will deploy a sidecar monitoring agent that analyzes logs for predefined trigger patterns related to performance drift or error spikes. These signals will be visualized in a centralized dashboard for the R&D team.\",\n      \"why\": \"This fulfills the regulatory requirement for identifying situations that may result in high-risk system failures.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
