ntific contribution to AI transparency.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Automated Regulatory Compliance Validator\",\n      \"what\": \"This is an internal auditing tool that automatically scans system logs and technical documentation for gaps relative to EU AI Act specifications. It acts as a pre-deployment gatekeeper.\",\n      \"how\": \"The team will build a verification suite that checks production logs for the presence of required fields, such as start and end times or person identifiers. It will flag any missing traceability elements before the system is released.\",\n      \"why\": \"It reduces the risk of human error during post-market monitoring and safeguards our institutional reputation.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
