t a specific AI decision using only the generated logs. This mimics a post-market monitoring inquiry from a regulator.\",\n      \"how\": \"An independent quality assurance team will select random output events and demand a full audit trail including input data and verifying personnel. We will document any gaps in the trace for immediate remediation.\",\n      \"why\": \"This proves our logging capabilities actually function before an external authority finds them lacking.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
