nder Annex III, point 1(a).\",\n      \"how\": \"We will build a secure interface that explicitly logs the identity of the human verifier and the specific reference database used during each match event. This module will generate immutable audit trails stored in an encrypted vault.\",\n      \"why\": \"It directly addresses the stringent requirements of Article 12(3) to prevent catastrophic legal liabilities in biometric applications.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
