enerator\",\n      \"what\": \"A tool that automatically transforms internal R&D experiment logs into structured technical documentation as required by Recital 71. It bridges the gap between raw data and regulatory prose.\",\n      \"how\": \"We will develop a system using specialized language models to synthesize training logs and validation metrics into clear, comprehensive compliance reports. The tool will map technical outputs to specific Article 12 requirements.\",\n      \"why\": \"It reduces administrative burdens on researchers while maintaining high scientific rigor in our official documentation.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
