arios to stress-test our logging hooks, ensuring no critical event is dropped during system crashes or peak loads.\",\n      \"why\": \"This ensures technical viability and prevents costly deployment delays caused by missing or corrupted regulatory logs.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
