stic failure modes?\n\nBut it's not a complete non-starter either. The core technique is sound and there are clear incremental paths to value. I'd give it a moderate promise score - maybe 35-45 range. It has some merit but as framed, it doesn't meet my bar for committing implementation resources.\n\nDecision: reject (as framed, it's too broad/research-oriented and the dataset component is too uncertain)\nPromise: ~40 (the core technique is sound and there's a viable narrow prototype path, but the proposal as written doesn't give me confidence in speed-to-delivery or bounded technical risk)\n",
